      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(tts): strip reasoning content from summarization output",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nTTS summarization output includes verbose reasoning/thinking content that should be stripped before being spoken aloud. Users hear long chains of reasoning instead of the actual answer — e.g. a weather query returns `<thinking>Let me think about this carefully. The user wants to know about weather.</thinking>The weather today is sunny with a high of 75°F.` but the TTS system reads the entire raw output including the thinking block.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nAdded a `tts` profile to `sanitizeAssistantVisibleTextWithProfile` in `src/shared/text/assistant-visible-text.ts` with strict reasoning stripping (`reasoningMode: \"strict\"`), tool-call removal, and internal-trace-line filtering. Exported `sanitizeForTts()` and applied it in `summarizeText()` (`src/tts/tts-core.ts`) before returning the summary. This follows the same profile pattern used by `final-answer-delivery`, `history`, `internal-scaffolding`, and `tool-progress` — the `tts` profile adds stricter stripping for speech synthesis.\n\nFixes #90364.\n\n## User Impact\n\n- **Before:** TTS reads raw model output including `<thinking>`, `<tool_call>`, `<function_calls>`, `<relevant-memories>` blocks and internal trace lines.\n- **After:** TTS reads only the clean, speech-ready response text.\n\n## Evidence\n\nDirect behavior probe with real function calls:\n\n```\n$ node --import tsx -e \"import('./src/shared/text/assistant-visible-text.js').then(({sanitizeForTts})=>console.log(JSON.stringify([{i:'<thinking>Internal reasoning.</thinking>The weather is sunny.',r:sanitizeForTts('<thinking>Internal reasoning.</thinking>The weather is sunny.'),e:'The weather is sunny.'},{i:'<thinking>First.</thinking>Result:<thinking>Second.</thinking>Final.',r:sanitizeForTts('<thinking>First.</thinking>Result:<thinking>Second.</thinking>Final.'),e:'Result:Final.'},{i:'<tool_call>{\\\"name\\\":\\\"search\\\"}</tool_call>Answer is 42.',r:sanitizeForTts('<tool_call>{\\\"name\\\":\\\"search\\\"}</tool_call>Answer is 42.'),e:'Answer is 42.'}])))\"\n[{\"i\":\"<thinking>Internal reasoning.</thinking>The weather is sunny.\",\"r\":\"The weather is sunny.\",\"e\":\"The weather is sunny.\"},{\"i\":\"<thinking>First.</thinking>Result:<thinking>Second.</thinking>Final.\",\"r\":\"Result:Final.\",\"e\":\"Result:Final.\"},{\"i\":\"<tool_call>{\\\"name\\\":\\\"search\\\"}</tool_call>Answer is 42.\",\"r\":\"Answer is 42.\",\"e\":\"Answer is 42.\"}]\n```\n\nTargeted tests:\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/tts/tts-core.test.ts\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n     Tests  4 passed (4)\n\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/shared/text/assistant-visible-text.test.ts\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n     Tests  120 passed (120)\n```\n",
        "branch": "fix/90364-tts-strip-reasoning",
